{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026YeYdjT7s1o1794842980.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>克里姆林宮就即將舉行的俄中美三國元首會晤發表聲明。</p><p></p><p>聲明指，俄羅斯總統普京將於周三會晤國家主席習近平。會談將重點討論俄中雙邊經貿合作前景，以及烏克蘭及朝鮮半島問題。預計亦會提到與美國的接觸情況，包括日前在迪拜阿布扎比舉行的會談。</p><p></p><p>聲明還提到周四舉行的三方會談，預料將對全球局勢產生重大影響。當前正就會後聯合聲明文本進行密集磋商。</p><p></p><p>普京同日還將與美國總統特朗普會晤，具體形式與地點仍有待確定。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T17:46:14.065713+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":195,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T14:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T13:07:40.915849+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T17:39:27.987946+00:00","content_hash":"9b54983dd038d7955a1f3ee09b6e7b7aff007a99e7d685fb2f05fa32b4de1531","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T17:46:14.065713+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}